Target project: the Supabase project behind `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` in
`v2/vcw4w/.env.example` (production: `https://4weird.games`).
Source files: `v2/vcw4w/supabase/migrations/` (17 files) + `v2/vcw4w/supabase/schema.sql`
(review copy) + `v2/vcw4w/supabase/functions/shopify-coins/index.ts`.

