## B. Edge function — terminal with Supabase CLI logged in

```
cd v2/vcw4w
supabase functions deploy shopify-coins --no-verify-jwt
supabase secrets set SUPABASE_URL=<project-url> SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon-key> SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<service-role-key> SHOPIFY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=<shopify-secret> SITE_ORIGINS="https://4weird.games,https://www.4weird.games"
```

`--no-verify-jwt` is required: Shopify webhooks use HMAC
(`X-Shopify-Hmac-Sha256` over the raw body), not Supabase JWTs.
SKU→coin amounts live ONLY in `COIN_SKU_MAP` in the function; never trust
prices/titles from Shopify. Order email is the coin authority; order IDs and
grant IDs are UNIQUE so retries cannot double-mint. Custom amounts
(`VIBE-COINS-CUSTOM`) mint from the verified paid line total at $0.01/coin,
floored at 500. Your Shopify store needs variants for the 500 / 1500 /
5000 / 25000 packs plus a $0.01-per-unit custom variant whose IDs go in
`COIN_PACK_VARIANTS` / `COIN_CUSTOM_VARIANT` (see `.env.example`).

## C. Vercel env vars (project → Settings → Environment Variables)

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`,
  `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://4weird.games`
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` (server-only; enables direct
  `/api/coins/claim` ledger writes + signup trial credit; without it, claim
  proxies to the edge function and no trial credit is issued)
- `FREE_TRIAL_VCOINS=100`, `SIGNUP_IP_HASH_SALT=<long-random-secret>`
- `COIN_PACK_VARIANTS=<id500,id1500,id5000,id25000>`,
  `COIN_CUSTOM_VARIANT=<custom-variant-id>` (from your Shopify variants)
- Optional: `SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN`, `SHOPIFY_ALLOWED_VARIANTS`,
  `VCW_SERVICE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID`

Root Directory stays `v2/vcw4w`. Redeploy after setting vars.

## D. Post-migration checks

- `GET /api/health` → `{"success":true,...}`
- Sign up → profiles row auto-created by trigger; with service key + salt set,
  100-coin ($1.00) trial credit appears in the ledger (once per IP).
- Authenticated `GET /api/coins/balance` returns integer balance; anonymous
  returns 503 "Supabase is not configured" only if env vars are missing.
- Save a game slot → row in game_saves; enabling Cheat Mode then writing
  keeps `cheat_mode:true` (trigger); delete from client is denied.
- Shopify test order → coins minted once; redeliver the webhook → no double
  mint (UNIQUE order/grant IDs).
